it-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":235265,"global_rank":93780},{"name":"jinyeom/Computational-Intelligence-Research","owner":"jinyeom","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyeom/Computational-Intelligence-Research","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Computational Intelligence Research","topics":[],"score":235263,"global_rank":93784},{"name":"jayshah19949596/American-Sign-Language-Recognition","owner":"jayshah19949596","html_url":"https://github.com/jayshah19949596/American-Sign-Language-Recognition","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Developed a program that lets users search dictionaries of American Sign Language (ASL), to look up the meaning of unknown signs using Dynamic Time Warping with custom features.","topics":["american-sign-language","american-sign-language-recognition","computer-vision","dtw","dynamic-time-warping","python","sign-recognition"],"score":235260,"global_rank":93786},{"name":"csanders-git/ModSecurity_Rule_Validator","owner":"csanders-git","html_url":"https://github.com/csanders-git/ModSecurity_Rule_Validator","stars":1,"forks":3,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A project that validates ModSecurity rules identically to how they are validated in C, but in python.","topics":[],"score":235257,"global_rank":93790},{"name":"lana-20/palindrome-python_leetcode","owner":"lana-20","html_url":"https://github.com/lana-20/palindrome-python_leetcode","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python Solutions to Palindrome Problems","topics":[],"score":235253,"global_rank":93804},{"name":"shadanan/zipdemo","owner":"shadanan","html_url":"https://github.com/shadanan/zipdemo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Streamlit app that compresses files.","topics":[],"score":235253,"global_rank":93808},{"name":"bencap/no-mans-ti","owner":"bencap","html_url"